# cloudsync iCloud filter — used with source 'iCloudAll' (~/Library/Mobile Documents)
# to back up exactly what Finder shows as "iCloud Drive":
#   - com~apple~CloudDocs/**   = loose iCloud Drive files (Desktop/Documents incl.)
#   - <any app container>/Documents/**  = each app's iCloud files (Obsidian, Preview, Pages, …)
# Everything else (app caches, .Trash, support data outside Documents) is excluded.
# Rules are first-match-wins, top to bottom.
+ /com~apple~CloudDocs/**
+ /*/Documents/**
- **
